<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>DevOps Engineer Portfolio</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <h1>[Your Name]</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Cloud & DevOps Engineer | Associate / Fresher</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        <!-- Skills Section -->
        <section id="skills">
            <h2>// Core Tech Stack</h2>
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Cloud & IaC</h3>
                    <p>AWS (EC2, S3, IAM), Terraform</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Containers & Orchestration</h3>
                    <p>Docker, Kubernetes (K8s)</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>CI/CD & Automation</h3>
                    <p>GitHub Actions, Linux/Bash Scripting</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Monitoring</h3>
                    <p>Prometheus, Grafana</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- DevOps Projects Section -->
        <section id="projects">
            <h2>// Featured DevOps Implementations</h2>
            
            <!-- Project 1 -->
            <div class="project-block">
                <h3>1. Automated End-to-End CI/CD Pipeline</h3>
                <p>Designed and built a declarative GitOps workflow that triggers on code changes, builds container images, and publishes them securely.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Tools Used:</strong> GitHub Actions, Docker, Docker Hub, SonarQube</li>
                    <li><strong>Outcome:</strong> Reduced manual deployment friction down to zero via full Git-triggered automation.</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="#" class="btn" target="_blank">View GitHub Repository</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Project 2 -->
            <div class="project-block">
                <h3>2. Infrastructure as Code (IaC) Architecture</h3>
                <p>Provisioned a modular, reusable AWS VPC environment using automated configuration management blueprints.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Tools Used:</strong> Terraform, AWS (VPC, EC2, Route53)</li>
                    <li><strong>Outcome:</strong> Allowed complete infrastructure rebuilds within minutes, eliminating manual configuration drift.</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="#" class="btn" target="_blank">View GitHub Repository</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Pipeline Status Section -->
        <section id="telemetry">
            <h2>// Live Site Telemetry</h2>
            <div class="status-box">
                <p>Deployment Automation: <span class="status-tag">GitHub Actions Active</span></p>
                <p>Hosting Environment: <span class="status-tag">AWS S3 / GitHub Pages Static Tier</span></p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 [Your Name]. Engineered from scratch using absolute CI/CD automation.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
